      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\nShotgun Short Stock by Quaternius (https://poly.pizza/m/MHv3uOV6ja);\r\n\r\n3D
    GUNS | Guns Pack by Shanshel - https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/props/weapons/3d-guns-guns-pack-228975#publisher\r\n\r\nN-GonForge
    Dungeon - Low Poly by N-Gon Forge - https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/dungeons/n-gonforge-dungeon-low-poly-303819\r\n\r\nDummy
    - https://www.mixamo.com/#/?page=1&query=crash+dummy&type=Character\r\n\r\nLow
    poly baseball bat by Biedny - https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/low-poly-baseball-bat-1b8119b4800d4c7981493ffb8050a58f\n\nRPG
    Monster Buddy PBR Polyart - Dungeon Mason\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/creatures/rpg-monster-buddy-pbr-polyart-253961\r\n\r\nRPG
    Monster Duo PBR Polyart - Dungeon Mason\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/creatures/rpg-monster-duo-pbr-polyart-157762\r\n\r\nMini
    Legion Footman PBR HP Polyart - Dungeon Mason\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/fantasy/mini-legion-footman-pbr-hp-polyart-86576\r\n\r\nMini
    Legion Grunt PBR HP Polyart - Dungeon Mason\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/fantasy/mini-legion-grunt-pbr-hp-polyart-98187\r\n\r\nMini
    Legion Lich PBR HP Polyart - Dungeon Mason\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/fantasy/mini-legion-lich-pbr-hp-polyart-91497\r\n\r\nStylized
    Low Poly Skeleton - SazenGames\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/fantasy/stylized-low-poly-skeleton-306857\r\n\r\nGhost
    character Free - Sigmoid Button Assets\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/creatures/ghost-character-free-267003\r\n\r\nGiant
    Monster Model - Golem - Kevin Iglesias\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/humanoids/fantasy/giant-monster-model-golem-278960\r\n\r\nGameDev
    Essential Kit - Capsule[Free Edition] - AssetHunts!\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/characters/gamedev-essential-kit-capsule-free-edition-307339\r\n\r\nEnvironment
    Assets used:\r\n\r\n3D Low Poly Nature Packs Free - ArchiBoxAsset \r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/3d/environments/landscapes/3d-low-poly-nature-packs-free-327057\r\n\r\nAudio
    Assets used:\r\n\r\nThe Alerted NPC (Male) - Voice Pack - VoiceBosch \r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/audio/sound-fx/voices/the-alerted-npc-male-voice-pack-301220\r\n\r\nWary
    NPC Guards (Male) - Voice Pack - VoiceBosch\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/audio/sound-fx/voices/wary-npc-guards-male-voice-pack-301314\r\n\r\nUrok
    the Orc-Orcish Voice Pack\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/audio/sound-fx/voices/urok-the-orc-orcish-voice-pack-301101\r\n\r\nDamage
    Sounds (Male) - NPC/Player Audio Pack - VoiceBosch\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/audio/sound-fx/voices/damage-sounds-male-npc-player-audio-pack-285385\r\n\r\nFantasy
    Menu SFX - Chris M Audio\r\nhttps://assetstore.unity.com/packages/audio/sound-fx/fantasy-menu-sfx-57238\r\n\r\nSome
    Music Downloaded from pixabay.com designated as non-copyright:\r\nThe Juggler
    - dcuttermusic\r\nUltrafunk music - no copyright 10 - RibhavAhrawal\r\nDrum and
    Bass | Another Day - TurtleBeats\r\nDrum and Bass | Neon Dreams - TurtleBeats\r\nDrum
    Or Bass - Ryan Stasik - BASSLOOM\r\nNo Remorse (Instrumental) - BrightestAvenue\r\nPhonkreign
    (FreeBackground Phonk Music) - LiteSaturation\r\nFree Phonk Music - Soundore\r\nBigfish
    - Sneaky Employee - bugfish\r\nDelire - Retrositive\r\nRain - Sixicane\r\nBLACK
    BOX - Dokev - BLACKBOX\r\n"
